From 88a5f40cc7381edfa1af9a4ebcb1795e85c40cd7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: UAW Recomp <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 18:56:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] vulkan: hoist mid-pass shared memory uploads to before the
 render pass

Uploads of guest memory that no draw in the open pass has read are recorded
at a hoist point placed before the pass begin, instead of ending the pass.
Avoids most render pass splits (expensive MSAA load/store on tile GPUs).
Cvar vulkan_hoist_shared_memory_uploads (default on).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JJM25S15YdvewrFFwP8g6Z
